{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"HADR"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"讲稿"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"Higher Algebra Done Right"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Higher Algebra Done Right 是"},{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"我"}},{"Plain":"和一些朋友 2023 年建立的群组, 以及 2026 年秋季学期组织的讨论班的名称. 具体安排将会发在<span class=\"link external\"><a href=\"https://simplicialcat.github.io\" title=\"我的个人主页 [https://simplicialcat.github.io]\">我的个人主页</a></span>.</p>\n"}]}}